OL,3,ADebris found from plane that went
OL,4,Amissing off US coast
OL,5,
OL,6,FUS authorities have found debris from a
OL,7,Fmedical transport aircraft that went
OL,8,Fmissing with six people on board.
OL,10,FThe Federal Aviation Administration
OL,11,Ftold the BBC it had lost contact with
OL,12,Fthe Gulfstream G-100 plane just after
OL,13,F01:00 local time (05:00 GMT) on
OL,14,FSaturday, while it was travelling from
OL,15,FBermuda to Boston, Massachusetts.
OL,17,FThe search for survivors continues off
OL,18,Fthe coast of Nantucket, a Massachusetts
OL,19,Fisland, the US Coast Guard said.
OL,23,APub: 03-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
