OL,3,ADebris found from plane that went
OL,4,Amissing off US coast
OL,5,
OL,6,FAuthorities have notified the next of
OL,7,Fkin of those on the flight, four
OL,8,FCanadian nationals and two Bermudian
OL,9,Fnationals.
